{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53686","headline":"惆怅诗 · 朱庆余","name":"惆怅诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梦里分明入汉宫，觉来灯背锦屏空。\n紫台日落关山晓，肠断君恩信画工。\n（见《才调集》卷八）（按：《才调集》卷七复收此诗於王涣名下，《全唐诗》卷六九○沿之。\n一书而两见，孰作较难确定，今重收之，以俟知者。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}